OL,3,GNEWSATip closure plan set to be dropped
OL,4,Aafter outcry                           
OL,6,FPlans to close a tip in Derbyshire are 
OL,7,Fset to be dropped after thousands of   
OL,8,Fresidents called for it to stay open.  
OL,10,FDerbyshire County Council had proposed 
OL,11,Fclosing Glossop Household Waste        
OL,12,FRecycling Centre in a bid to save      
OL,13,F#360,000 a year in running costs.      
OL,15,FBut council officers have recommended  
OL,16,Fkeeping the site open only to residents
OL,17,Fin Derbyshire, when the authority's    
OL,18,Fcabinet meets on 26 November.          
OL,20,FThe move could mean 25%-30% less waste 
OL,21,Fbeing collected at the Melandra Road   
OL,22,Fsite.                                  
